@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Digital Watch

state StartWatch
state HourAdjustment
state MinuteAdjustment
state AlarmHourAdjustment
state AlarmMinuteAdjustment
state AlarmOn[*]
state AlarmOff
state LightOn[*]
state LightOff

StartWatch:! --> HourAdjustment: Start Adjusting Time
HourAdjustment:! --> AlarmHourAdjustment: Switch to Alarm Hour Adjustment
AlarmHourAdjustment:! --> AlarmMinuteAdjustment: Switch to Alarm Minute Adjustment
AlarmMinuteAdjustment:! --> LightOn[*]: Turn on Light and Continue Adjusting Time
LightOn[*] --> AlarmOff: Alarm Off
LightOn[*] --> LightOff: Alarm On
LightOff:! --> HourAdjustment: Switch to Hour Adjustment
HourAdjustment:! --> MinuteAdjustment: Switch to Minute Adjustment
MinuteAdjustment:! --> StartWatch: Return to Starting State

AlarmOn[*] --> AlarmOn[*]: Continue Adjusting Alarm Time if Necessary
AlarmOff:! --> AlarmOn[*]: Turn on Alarm and Switch to Alarm Hour Adjustment

LightOn[*] --> LightOn[*]: Continue Light On if Necessary
LightOff:! --> LightOff: Continue Light Off

@enduml
